"""English for platform-templated Agent prose (D-10 follow-up).

Keys are the literal Chinese pieces of the platform's message f-strings, one
line each; ``{name}`` marks an interpolated value that passes through raw.
``marvis.ui_locale_prose`` translates a served line only when these templates
(plus the exact labels in ``marvis.ui_locale_en``) explain all of its Chinese.
Stored messages stay canonical Chinese. Deterministic values, field names and
user data are never keys here.

Sections follow the source modules so a changed template is easy to find.
"""

